26\" data-w=\"12\">the</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"13\">centre;</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"14\">it</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"15\">has</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"16\">tools;</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"17\">and</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"18\">there</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"19\">is</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"20\">some</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"21\">autonomy,</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"22\">meaning</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"23\">it</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"24\">can</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"25\">plan,</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"26\">reflect</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"27\">on</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"28\">its</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"29\">own</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"30\">output</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"31\">and</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"32\">use</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"33\">real-world</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"34\">feedback.</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"h-163-common-tools\"><span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"0\">16.3</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"1\">Common</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"2\">tools</span></h4>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr>\n<th>Tool</th>\n<th>What it adds</th>\n</tr>\n</thead><tbody><tr>\n<td>Web search</td>\n<td>up-to-date knowledge, which fixes the training cut-off</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Code interpreter</td>\n<td>exact maths and actually running code, instead of guessing the output</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API calls</td>\n<td>read data (YouTube, a calendar, a database) and take actions (send an email), in both directions</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Computer use</td>\n<td>click and type through a screen when a program has no API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Another model</td>\n<td>for example an image generator the LLM can call</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Retrieval (RAG)</td>\n<td>search your own documents (Chapter 18)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Memory</td>\n<td>keep information across calls or conversations</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<h4 id=\"h-164-three-levels-of-agency\"><span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"0\">16.4</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"1\">Three</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"2\">levels</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"3\">of</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"4\">agency</span></h4>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr>\n<th>Level</th>\n<th>What it is</th>\n<th>Example</th>\n<th>Loan example</th>\n</tr>\n</thead><tbody><tr>\n<td>1. LLM plus tools</td>\n<td>One model with a few tools</td>\n<td>A model with web search and a code interpreter</td>\n<td>A model with a SQL tool answers \"how many offers were declined?\"</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. LLM workflow</td>\n<td>A predefined sequence of steps, with at least one LLM inside</td>\n<td>Email: is it junk? If not, is it easy or hard? Easy ones go to an LLM writer, hard ones are left for you</td>\n<td>Classify a case, route it, draft the reply</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. LLM in a loop</td>\n<td>The model acts, gets feedback and tries again until checks pass</td>\n<td>A LinkedIn writer whose drafts are checked for similarity to your posts, AI-sounding text and match to the idea; failed checks go back to the writer</td>\n<td>Write SQL, run it, read the error or result, fix and retry</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p><span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"0\">Why</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"1\">split</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"2\">a</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"3\">task</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"4\">in</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"5\">a</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"6\">workflow?</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"0\">Deciding</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"1\">junk,</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"2\">easy</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"3\">or</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"4\">hard</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"5\">in</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"6\">one</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"7\">call</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"8\">is</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"9\">harder</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"10\">than</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"11\">two</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"12\">simpler</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"13\">calls,</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"14\">and</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"15\">the</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"16\">first</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"17\">step</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"18\">may</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"19\">not</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"20\">even</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"21\">need</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"22\">an</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"23\">LLM:</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"24\">a</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"25\">small</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"26\">trained</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"27\">classifier</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"28\">could</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"29\">do</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"30\">it</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"31\">(Chapters</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"32\">9</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"33\">and</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"34\">13).</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"h-165-five-workflow-patterns\"><span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"0\">16.5</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"1\">Five</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"2\">workflow</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"3\">patterns</span></h4>\n<p><span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"0\">From</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"1\">Anthropic's</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"2\">post</span> <a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/building-effective-agents\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"3\">Building</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"4\">effective</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"5\">agents</span></a><span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"5\">,</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"6\">with</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"7\">Shaw</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"8\">Talebi's</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"9\">examples:</span></p>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<th>How it works</th>\n<th>When to use it</th>\n<th>Loan example</th>\n</tr>\n</thead><tbody><tr>\n<td>Prompt chaining</td>\n<td>Step A feeds step B feeds step C</td>\n<td>The task splits cleanly into fixed steps</td>\n<td>Extract fields from a document, then validate them, then summarize</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Routing</td>\n<td>Classify the input, then take a different path for each class</td>\n<td>Different inputs need different handling</td>\n<td>SQL question, policy question, or both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Parallelization: sectioning</td>\n<td>Run independent subtasks at the same time</td>\n<td>Speed, or separate concerns</td>\n<td>Answer the question while a second call checks the request against your rules</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Parallelization: voting</td>\n<td>Run the same task several times and combine the answers</td>\n<td>You need reliability on a hard judgement</td>\n<td>Ask 10 LLM calls to score a risk case and take the majority</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Orchestrator-workers</td>\n<td>A planner LLM decides the steps, then hands them to workers</td>\n<td>The steps cannot be known in advance</td>\n<td>A request needing a mix of lookups and calculations</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Evaluator-optimizer</td>\n<td>One LLM writes, another reviews, and they loop until a stopping rule is met</td>\n<td>There are clear criteria and feedback helps</td>\n<td>Generate SQL, check it against the schema, regenerate</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p><span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"1\">evaluator-optimizer</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"2\">is</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"3\">different</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"4\">from</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"5\">the</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"6\">others,</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"7\">which</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"8\">all</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"9\">have</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"10\">a</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"11\">clear</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"12\">start</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"13\">and</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"14\">end.</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"0\">Because</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"1\">it</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"2\">is</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"3\">a</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"4\">loop,</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"5\">it</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"6\">can</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"7\">in</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"8\">principle</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"9\">run</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"10\">for</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"11\">ever,</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"12\">so</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"13\">it</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"14\">carries</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"15\">the</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"16\">most</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"17\">agency,</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"18\">and</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"19\">it</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"20\">needs</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"21\">a</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"22\">stopping</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"23\">rule.</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"h-166-a-loop-can-also-be-trained\"><span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"0\">16.6</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"1\">A</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"2\">loop</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"3\">can</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"4\">also</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"5\">be</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"6\">trained</span></h4>\n<p><span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"0\">In</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"1\">level</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"2\">3</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"3\">the</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"4\">model's</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"5\">weights</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"6\">stay</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"7\">fixed</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"8\">and</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"9\">you</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"10\">add</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"11\">checks</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"12\">around</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"13\">it.</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"1\">other</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"2\">option</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"3\">is</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"4\">to</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"5\">train</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"7\">model</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"8\">itself</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"9\">on</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"10\">the</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"11\">real-world</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"12\">feedback</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"13\">with</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"14\">reinforcement</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"15\">learning,</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"16\">so</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"17\">that</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"18\">it</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"19\">improves</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"20\">the</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"21\">more</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"22\">it</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"23\">works.</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"0\">Shaw</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"1\">Talebi</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"2\">says</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"3\">this</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"4\">is</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"5\">the</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"6\">idea</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"7\">behind</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"8\">deep</span> <